{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game is introduced</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Girl2 is a story-rich spot-the-difference game with interactive choices and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a demon hunter and explore a world of seductive spirits, forgotten memories, and fateful encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hidden detail you uncover reveals more of each girl's mysterious past\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And your choices will decide their destiny: to conquer, to redeem... or to lose them forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Role Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butterfly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl named Yingtai who met in the garden was struggling to find her lost memory and her lifelong pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158500/extras/b9f0aabb71d27a94c3fe5fbd5e7b99ab.poster.avif?t=1769349180\" width=500 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158500/extras/b9f0aabb71d27a94c3fe5fbd5e7b99ab.webm?t=1769349180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158500/extras/b9f0aabb71d27a94c3fe5fbd5e7b99ab.mp4?t=1769349180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qing &amp;Bai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue and white sisters who came to chat up next to the West Lake, the old bridge in rainy days, held up an oil-paper umbrella. This scene seems to have been seen somewhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158500/extras/7cda184370741dbf21288057eaf9ede9.poster.avif?t=1769349